  "body": "There's no particular reason. You should simply consider those values not meaningful when the method is set to \"Camera\" or \"Auto\". In any case, the temperature/tint values make sense only inside ART, they won't translate to another app, as different programs use different formulas to calculate the temperature from the wb coefficients.\n\nHTH",
